# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[trust]] to the care of.
#* {{quote-book|en |year=2004 |title=Uncanny Networks: Dialogues with the Virtual Intelligentsia |author=Geert Lovink |page=1742|ISBN=0262621878|passage=The first step toward finding a way out of this place begins when we take a flamethrower to Newt Gingrich cum Alvin Toffler style laissez-faire futurism, which '''entrusts''' our collective fate to the tender mercies of the marketplace, or New Age cyberbole that would have us pin our hopes to a millennial blastoff.}}
#: ''Can I '''entrust''' you with a secret?''
#: ''He '''entrusted''' me his daughter.''
#: ''He '''entrusts''' that task to her.''

